{"t":"The Ruthless Seven Minions","s":"the-ruthless-seven-minions-ba069","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Annihilon_04f1e7.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>There are fourteen minions of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Ruthless%20Seven\">The Ruthless Seven</a> with high ranks on the demon society, which can be split into two groups. \n</p><p>The first group guards the <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Forge\">Demon Forge</a> where some sort of ritual is being prepared for their leaders. This group consists of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ushuriel\">Ushuriel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Madareth\">Madareth</a>, the brothers <a href=\"#/wiki/Golgordan\">Golgordan</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Latrivan\">Latrivan</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zugurosh\">Zugurosh</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgorak\">Hellgorak</a>.\n</p><p>The second group works for the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ascending%20Ferumbras\">Ascending Ferumbras</a> and helps him in his goal to gain godlike powers. They are <a href=\"#/wiki/Mazoran\">Mazoran</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Plagirath\">Plagirath</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ragiaz\">Ragiaz</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Razzagorn\">Razzagorn</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Shulgrax\">Shulgrax</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarbaz\">Tarbaz</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Zamulosh\">Zamulosh</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Ruthless_Seven_Minions_-_Guardians_of_the_Demon_Forge\">The Ruthless Seven Minions - Guardians of the Demon Forge</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Exp\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">HP\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Loot\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\"><img alt=\"Annihilon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Annihilon_04f1e